WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.617 --> 00:00:04.510
- All right, Darnetta.
- Yes.

00:00:04.510 --> 00:00:05.710
- Darnetta, where'd you grow up?

00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:06.543
Where are you from originally?

00:00:06.543 --> 00:00:08.660
- I was born in Oakland, California,

00:00:08.660 --> 00:00:11.440
but I've been here in
Los Angeles ever since

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:12.649
I was two years old.

00:00:12.649 --> 00:00:14.350
- Okay. And tell me about your family.

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.320
You grew up with both your parents?

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.190
- Until I was 10 years old.

00:00:18.190 --> 00:00:22.563
At the time when I was 10,
I was molested by my father.

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.840
First time I had sex I got pregnant

00:00:26.840 --> 00:00:30.390
so I came downtown to the
St Anne's maternity home

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:33.710
over in the Everardo area.

00:00:33.710 --> 00:00:35.020
Stayed there.

00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:36.206
- What age was this?

00:00:36.206 --> 00:00:37.520
- I was 10.

00:00:37.520 --> 00:00:39.150
- You were pregnant at 10?
- Yes.

00:00:39.150 --> 00:00:40.480
- Jesus.

00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:43.873
- First time I had sex I got
pregnant, it was by my dad.

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:50.837
I stayed there for
about six weeks and then

00:00:52.270 --> 00:00:56.653
I agreed to have an abortion
to go home, back home.

00:00:57.750 --> 00:01:01.713
At the time we were living
in Compton, California.

00:01:09.007 --> 00:01:12.340
I stayed at home, maybe for about a year

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.540
then I started running away from home.

00:01:17.540 --> 00:01:20.710
I was in and out of McLaren
hall, different foster homes.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:23.483
I was in like 14, 15 foster homes.

00:01:25.155 --> 00:01:27.580
- Did the sexual abuse
with your dad continue?

00:01:27.580 --> 00:01:32.580
- Yes, I only had sex with
my father until I was, what?

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:38.330
19, 20 years old.

00:01:38.330 --> 00:01:39.913
I'd never had another man.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:45.920
I had my daughter at 16, which
is also my little sister.

00:01:46.612 --> 00:01:48.563
I had her by my father.

00:01:52.550 --> 00:01:54.540
I have two children now.

00:01:54.540 --> 00:01:57.080
When I was 21, I had another,

00:01:57.080 --> 00:02:01.703
well, seven years later I
had another child, a boy.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:08.573
I've been downtown ever since 1984.

00:02:11.640 --> 00:02:15.480
The beginning of 84, like
the first of the year.

00:02:15.480 --> 00:02:17.990
When I first moved down here, I moved into

00:02:17.990 --> 00:02:20.810
where the st Mark's is the 611,

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:22.460
the woman and children's shelter.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:29.260
I've been downtown ever since.

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:31.980
I was homeless 20 years.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:36.080
Down here I just got my housing
about maybe three years ago.

00:02:36.080 --> 00:02:36.920
Permanent housing.

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.830
I was a transit down here on the street,

00:02:39.830 --> 00:02:42.080
in the tents and you know,

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.633
I lived in every last one of
these hotels, downtown area.

00:02:49.170 --> 00:02:51.980
I don't have a really
bad criminal background.

00:02:51.980 --> 00:02:56.980
I have a couple of drug sales, you know.

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.170
- So let's back up to your parents.

00:02:59.170 --> 00:03:02.160
So did your dad ever do any prison time

00:03:02.160 --> 00:03:03.147
for what he did to you?

00:03:03.147 --> 00:03:08.147
- No. My mother kept
him, so I mean, you know,

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.890
it was just something that, you know,

00:03:13.890 --> 00:03:15.963
she chose to say it was my fault.

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:19.390
Something about it was my fault.

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:20.290
- At 10 years old.

00:03:21.130 --> 00:03:25.240
- Yeah, well, I was womanish, I was fast

00:03:25.240 --> 00:03:28.670
and I enticed him or whatever.

00:03:28.670 --> 00:03:32.040
I mean, between that
and her trying to refuse

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:35.010
that it was even happening at all.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:38.156
She knew it was happening
because she knew I was pregnant.

00:03:38.156 --> 00:03:39.899
- Yeah, that's a pretty good sign,

00:03:39.899 --> 00:03:44.640
- So I had my baby, I
went back home with my mom

00:03:44.640 --> 00:03:47.110
and I stayed there for
about like six months.

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.823
We were living in Carson then.

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:57.930
I, you know, had both of my kids with me

00:03:57.930 --> 00:04:00.710
till my daughter was like maybe 10.

00:04:00.710 --> 00:04:04.723
Till '84 when I had my son, in '83.

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:09.710
I came downtown, I applied for GR,

00:04:09.710 --> 00:04:12.400
I came downtown, they put me at the 611.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:14.303
And I've been downtown ever since.

00:04:15.392 --> 00:04:18.948
- So your kids were raised by you?

00:04:18.948 --> 00:04:20.800
- They were raised by me,

00:04:20.800 --> 00:04:23.200
my daughter stayed with
me until she was 10

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:25.583
then she stayed with my mom.

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:29.990
My son was raised by my boyfriend.

00:04:29.990 --> 00:04:33.340
I only had one boyfriend
all through school.

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:35.326
And so my son was raised by him.

00:04:35.326 --> 00:04:36.260
(cell phone rings)

00:04:36.260 --> 00:04:37.280
That's my phone.

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:38.689
- That's your phone.

00:04:38.689 --> 00:04:41.977
So your daughter went with your mom,

00:04:41.977 --> 00:04:43.870
was your dad still in the picture?

00:04:43.870 --> 00:04:45.810
- Well, he was still alive, you know.

00:04:45.810 --> 00:04:49.233
Him and my mom weren't together, but yeah.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:51.498
She went in with my mom.

00:04:51.498 --> 00:04:56.498
I mean it was like preferable
to her going into foster care.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:58.460
I had been in foster care,

00:04:58.460 --> 00:05:01.173
so I didn't want her to go in foster care.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:09.050
I gave her to my mom to, you
know, she wanted my daughter.

00:05:11.023 --> 00:05:12.325
- And you were on the streets so.

00:05:12.325 --> 00:05:15.470
- And she didn't want my baby.

00:05:15.470 --> 00:05:20.470
So I was in the streets
of Long Beach for a while.

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.200
And then I came downtown,
like on a fluke with,

00:05:24.200 --> 00:05:28.920
a friend of mine came
down to apply for GR.

00:05:28.920 --> 00:05:33.240
And I applied, the only
time I've ever been on GR.

00:05:33.240 --> 00:05:34.860
- So you have a son as well?

00:05:34.860 --> 00:05:37.393
- I have a son as well, he's 35.

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:42.010
36, actually, he'll be 36 next month.

00:05:42.010 --> 00:05:43.010
- So you raised him?

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.950
- No, he was raised, when he was three,

00:05:46.950 --> 00:05:51.270
well I had them both till
she was 10 and he was three.

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:52.950
That's when I came downtown.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.510
And when I came down--
- Where'd your son go?

00:05:54.510 --> 00:05:57.220
- My son was raised by
one of my boyfriends.

00:05:57.220 --> 00:06:00.913
He, you know, was there
when my son was born.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:03.184
- He wasn't the father, but--

00:06:03.184 --> 00:06:05.210
- No, he wasn't the father.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:07.050
That's one of the problems that I have

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:08.363
with my son right now.

00:06:09.600 --> 00:06:11.811
'Cause my son is mixed
with Mexican and black,

00:06:11.811 --> 00:06:13.830
so Greg, big difference.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.750
But he was my boyfriend for

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:18.530
all the time I was in junior high school.

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:21.733
My first boyfriend other than my dad.

00:06:22.920 --> 00:06:26.210
So he raised my son.

00:06:26.210 --> 00:06:29.640
He came to the County
building, he got my son

00:06:29.640 --> 00:06:34.640
and he raised him until he was grown.

00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:41.660
I recently been back in my son's life,

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:44.463
maybe about a year and a half.

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:49.883
And he came down, he found me,

00:06:52.840 --> 00:06:56.130
actually right before he had his son.

00:06:56.130 --> 00:06:58.470
Right when he had his
son, and his son is seven.

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:03.470
So he's been back in my life
like seven years, my son.

00:07:03.583 --> 00:07:07.143
My daughter, she lives in Antelope Valley.

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:14.710
She just recently found out
within the last seven years

00:07:14.710 --> 00:07:18.350
about me and her having the same father.

00:07:18.350 --> 00:07:20.982
You know, she really didn't know.

00:07:20.982 --> 00:07:24.760
She had, you know, thoughts about it,

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.120
but she didn't really know the truth.

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:30.953
- Yeah.

00:07:32.903 --> 00:07:35.190
- Like I said, I've
been a transit down here

00:07:35.190 --> 00:07:38.550
for the last, going on 30 years.

00:07:38.550 --> 00:07:40.870
- Do you say--
- I just recently

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:44.220
acquired permanent housing.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:47.120
I live in the Alexander hotel right now.

00:07:47.120 --> 00:07:49.940
- Do you use any of the drugs
that are on the street here?

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:51.100
- Yeah, I was an addict.

00:07:51.100 --> 00:07:54.770
I was a crack addict, you
know, for the last 20 years.

00:07:54.770 --> 00:07:58.988
I started using crack
when I was about maybe,

00:07:58.988 --> 00:08:01.920
after my son was born.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:06.920
And basically I've been a crack addict.

00:08:06.960 --> 00:08:10.210
You know, I've been in
recovery for the last year

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:14.870
trying to get my life together.

00:08:14.870 --> 00:08:19.140
I have relapse problems, but (laughs)

00:08:19.140 --> 00:08:21.160
- What do you do for money now?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:24.020
- I finally have an income after 20 years

00:08:24.020 --> 00:08:25.983
of being here with no income at all.

00:08:27.273 --> 00:08:30.703
I'm on disability, SSI disability.

00:08:31.716 --> 00:08:33.947
- Until you got that, how
were you supporting yourself?

00:08:33.947 --> 00:08:35.760
- That's how I support myself.

00:08:35.760 --> 00:08:37.300
- No, but before that.

00:08:37.300 --> 00:08:41.320
- Before that, crack
sales, I sold enough dope,

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:42.560
I was a worker.

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.380
I sold enough dope to pay my, you know,

00:08:45.380 --> 00:08:47.650
buy me a outfit every day.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:52.650
You know, eat, pay my rent.

00:08:53.140 --> 00:08:54.950
Because I lived in all of these hotels

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.970
before they turned SRO.

00:08:56.970 --> 00:08:59.910
I was paying by the day 20, 30.

00:08:59.910 --> 00:09:02.853
I mean, $50, $60 a day.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:08.250
So I made enough money, you know.

00:09:08.250 --> 00:09:12.540
I have five sales cases now
and other cases that I have are

00:09:15.640 --> 00:09:17.440
me having my own sack.

00:09:17.440 --> 00:09:19.730
I was just, I never was a baller,

00:09:19.730 --> 00:09:21.060
I just was a worker.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:21.893
- Yeah.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:28.700
- I still have problems every now and then

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.760
with my, you know, with my addiction.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:36.293
Finding something to replace
the addiction is the problem.

00:09:41.320 --> 00:09:43.690
- Do you still have
contact with your family?

00:09:43.690 --> 00:09:47.580
- My two children, I'm the
only one left of my family.

00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:49.470
It's me and my two kids.

00:09:49.470 --> 00:09:51.743
Yes, I still have contact with them. Yeah.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.350
My son, he was in prison.

00:09:55.350 --> 00:09:58.490
He did seven years for abuse.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:02.440
He has problems with women,
mostly it's my fault.

00:10:02.440 --> 00:10:06.700
Because I was the crack head

00:10:06.700 --> 00:10:08.640
that he heard about all his life.

00:10:08.640 --> 00:10:11.830
He was just like your mom,
she's a crack head on skid row.

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:14.220
That's all he ever heard all his life.

00:10:14.220 --> 00:10:17.533
So he has mental problems, you know,

00:10:18.830 --> 00:10:22.200
I guess insanity runs
in our family (laughs)

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:26.597
but yeah, dysfunction.

00:10:28.630 --> 00:10:30.640
- Yeah, that's a common story down here.

00:10:31.748 --> 00:10:33.440
Do you think if your
childhood had been different

00:10:33.440 --> 00:10:36.493
that your life might've led
you down a different path?

00:10:37.440 --> 00:10:39.140
- I'm pretty sure.
- Yeah.

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:41.280
- I'm pretty sure.
- Would you say

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:42.220
your parents were the--

00:10:42.220 --> 00:10:44.807
- My mom was a groupie, you know,

00:10:44.807 --> 00:10:48.110
she was the definition
of a groupie, you know,

00:10:48.110 --> 00:10:50.793
up North she was part
of the Pather family.

00:10:55.610 --> 00:10:56.490
They were groupies.

00:10:56.490 --> 00:11:00.590
You know, my auntie has a
son by Johnny guitar Watson,

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:05.590
you know, the music field,
you know, she was a groupie.

00:11:09.306 --> 00:11:10.690
(laughs)

00:11:10.690 --> 00:11:14.630
They used to drop pills and
go to concerts and you know,

00:11:14.630 --> 00:11:17.200
me and my cousin, they
had to take us with them.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:20.010
So, you know, we grew up together.

00:11:20.010 --> 00:11:24.920
She, you know, my dad, he was security.

00:11:24.920 --> 00:11:28.050
He worked at the Federal
Reserve Bank of San Francisco

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:31.120
right here on Olympic
and Grant for 35 years,

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.293
he retired from there.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.673
He's dead now.

00:11:35.960 --> 00:11:40.069
But if he was alive, I mean basically,

00:11:40.069 --> 00:11:42.840
all of my relationships are dysfunctional

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:46.920
based on my dysfunctional beginnings.

00:11:49.060 --> 00:11:52.543
You know, I was married for five years.

00:11:53.890 --> 00:11:55.653
I'm just recently divorced.

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:02.840
All of my relationships are
dysfunctional based on it.

00:12:02.840 --> 00:12:05.810
So yes, I believe if my
beginnings were different,

00:12:05.810 --> 00:12:08.337
I would have had a different outcome.

00:12:08.337 --> 00:12:09.620
- Different role models.

00:12:09.620 --> 00:12:11.804
- Different, yeah.
- A little more--

00:12:11.804 --> 00:12:16.730
- I was, you know, everything
that was right was wrong

00:12:16.730 --> 00:12:20.510
and everything that was wrong was right.

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:23.310
I mean, that's the way it
has always been with me.

00:12:23.310 --> 00:12:25.280
You know, starting with my dad.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:27.810
I mean all of the tears for healing,

00:12:27.810 --> 00:12:31.310
all of the things, you know,
me knowing it wasn't my fault.

00:12:31.310 --> 00:12:35.340
I was a child who, you know,
of molestation and all of that.

00:12:35.340 --> 00:12:37.540
It really didn't pan out with me because

00:12:37.540 --> 00:12:40.210
I was in love with my father.

00:12:40.210 --> 00:12:42.020
My father was my everything.

00:12:42.020 --> 00:12:44.440
He did everything for me, you know.

00:12:44.440 --> 00:12:46.990
That was the only thing that was wrong.

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:51.940
And so, you know, all my
relationships are dysfunctional

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:53.490
because of that.

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:56.550
You know, I believe if
I'm not getting paid

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:58.350
or whatever for it,

00:12:58.350 --> 00:13:01.583
so that made me have a
dysfunctional marriage.

00:13:02.550 --> 00:13:05.690
You know, I had issues because of that.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:06.523
- Yeah.

00:13:06.523 --> 00:13:09.560
- You know, basically that's where I'm at

00:13:09.560 --> 00:13:10.994
and I'm still downtown.

00:13:10.994 --> 00:13:12.990
(laughs)

00:13:12.990 --> 00:13:13.823
- All right, Darnetta.

00:13:13.823 --> 00:13:14.720
Well, thank you so much for talking to me

00:13:14.720 --> 00:13:15.870
and sharing your story.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:18.383
Good luck with everything.

